{
    "title": "Galileo Health: Medical Care",
    "description": "Galileo is the online doctor you\u2019ve been searching for\u2014available nationwide.\u2028\r\n\r\nCHAT WITH DOCTORS 24/7\r\nGet 24/7 health care on your phone anytime and anywhere you need it, no appointment or insurance necessary. Text with real doctors about your symptoms and get care for almost any health issue, from the mundane to the mysterious.\u2028\r\n\r\nSAME-DAY HEALTH HELP\r\nOur team of friendly, expert doctors listens to your symptoms, provides personalized medical diagnosis and treatment, writes and renews prescriptions, orders lab tests, refers to specialists, and cares for you long term.\u2028\r\n\r\nANY CARE YOU CAN IMAGINE\r\nUse Galileo for primary, specialty, and urgent care. Almost any health concern\u2014from colds to high cholesterol\u2014is handled virtually. You\u2019ll never make an unnecessary trip to the doctor\u2019s office again.\u2028\r\nUrgent care: Cold and flu, UTIs, pink eye, STD testing, migraines, constipation, diarrhea\r\nEveryday care: Prescriptions and refills, birth control, hair loss, PrEP, healthy living, fatigue, dermatology\r\nChronic conditions: Diabetes, hypertension, anxiety and depression, high cholesterol, insomnia, anemia, hypothyroidism\u2028\r\n\r\nTELL US WHAT\u2019S WRONG\r\nFill out a short intake form for a specific health condition (like UTIs, STDs, or acne)\u2014or start a general chat if you don\u2019t know what\u2019s going on.\u2028\r\n\r\nGALILEO AS A BENEFIT\r\nJoining Galileo through your health insurance or as a work benefit? Congratulations\u2014your membership is covered. Copays or deductibles may apply.\u2028\u2028\r\n\r\nYOUR HEALTH STUFF IN ONE PLACE\r\nUse your profile to sync medical records, tell us your current health status, and pick care preferences.\u2028\r\n\r\nFOR THE MASSES\r\nWe're proud to provide affordable digital health care to thousands of people like you. Get in touch with us anytime with questions or feedback by using our in-app Patient Support chat or emailing support@galileohealth.com.\u2028\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\r\n\u201cGetting medical care through Galileo was the most convenient and comprehensive health experience I\u2019ve had in quite a while. I feel comfortable using Galileo for the majority of my health needs.\u201d \u2014Melissa\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\r\n\u201cAll the Galileo doctors have been so helpful and respond in a very timely manner. I\u2019m so thankful for all that the Galileo team has done for me and countless others!\u201d \u2014Alec\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\r\n\u201cLiving in a rural area without insurance, Galileo has been an absolute lifesaver. The format allows me to fully explain myself and my history without dealing with time constraints. I truly hope this is the future of care.\u201d \u2014Justine",
    "descriptionHTML": "Galileo is the online doctor you\u2019ve been searching for\u2014available nationwide.\u2028<br><br>CHAT WITH DOCTORS 24/7<br>Get 24/7 health care on your phone anytime and anywhere you need it, no appointment or insurance necessary. Text with real doctors about your symptoms and get care for almost any health issue, from the mundane to the mysterious.\u2028<br><br>SAME-DAY HEALTH HELP<br>Our team of friendly, expert doctors listens to your symptoms, provides personalized medical diagnosis and treatment, writes and renews prescriptions, orders lab tests, refers to specialists, and cares for you long term.\u2028<br><br>ANY CARE YOU CAN IMAGINE<br>Use Galileo for primary, specialty, and urgent care. Almost any health concern\u2014from colds to high cholesterol\u2014is handled virtually. You\u2019ll never make an unnecessary trip to the doctor\u2019s office again.\u2028<br>Urgent care: Cold and flu, UTIs, pink eye, STD testing, migraines, constipation, diarrhea<br>Everyday care: Prescriptions and refills, birth control, hair loss, PrEP, healthy living, fatigue, dermatology<br>Chronic conditions: Diabetes, hypertension, anxiety and depression, high cholesterol, insomnia, anemia, hypothyroidism\u2028<br><br>TELL US WHAT\u2019S WRONG<br>Fill out a short intake form for a specific health condition (like UTIs, STDs, or acne)\u2014or start a general chat if you don\u2019t know what\u2019s going on.\u2028<br><br>GALILEO AS A BENEFIT<br>Joining Galileo through your health insurance or as a work benefit? Congratulations\u2014your membership is covered. Copays or deductibles may apply.\u2028\u2028<br><br>YOUR HEALTH STUFF IN ONE PLACE<br>Use your profile to sync medical records, tell us your current health status, and pick care preferences.\u2028<br><br>FOR THE MASSES<br>We&#39;re proud to provide affordable digital health care to thousands of people like you. Get in touch with us anytime with questions or feedback by using our in-app Patient Support chat or emailing support@galileohealth.com.\u2028<br><br>\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<br>\u201cGetting medical care through Galileo was the most convenient and comprehensive health experience I\u2019ve had in quite a while. I feel comfortable using Galileo for the majority of my health needs.\u201d \u2014Melissa<br><br>\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<br>\u201cAll the Galileo doctors have been so helpful and respond in a very timely manner. I\u2019m so thankful for all that the Galileo team has done for me and countless others!\u201d \u2014Alec<br><br>\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605<br>\u201cLiving in a rural area without insurance, Galileo has been an absolute lifesaver. The format allows me to fully explain myself and my history without dealing with time constraints. I truly hope this is the future of care.\u201d \u2014Justine",
